1
00:00:00,059 --> 00:00:02,079
As a caregiver, you run the medications.

2
00:00:02,419 --> 00:00:03,039
The paperwork.

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,099
The rides.

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,359
The family calendar.

5
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:06,819
The two a.m. calls.

6
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:11,359
And every year there are more people who need care, and fewer of us to give it.

7
00:00:12,039 --> 00:00:13,199
This is RUA.

8
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,239
Built for caregivers.

9
00:00:16,059 --> 00:00:18,180
It opens on the one thing that needs you today.

10
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,259
The insurance appeal that eats your whole afternoon?

11
00:00:22,299 --> 00:00:23,139
Drop in the letter.

12
00:00:24,439 --> 00:00:27,199
RUA assembles the packet, and you confirm every fact.

13
00:00:27,719 --> 00:00:30,169
Three and a half hours, down to twelve minutes.

14
00:00:30,319 --> 00:00:33,369
Scan a bottle. It knows the medicine, and adds it to their list.

15
00:00:34,229 --> 00:00:36,070
An ER sheet that is always current.

16
00:00:36,869 --> 00:00:39,349
A handoff pack, so someone can take your place for a weekend.

17
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:42,550
Your family claims the week, turn by turn.

18
00:00:43,429 --> 00:00:44,869
Every way to reach her, compared.

19
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,709
Offline guides for the moments that matter most.

20
00:00:48,330 --> 00:00:50,580
A one-pager to carry into the appointment.

21
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:53,380
Every visit, prepared before you walk in.

22
00:00:53,930 --> 00:00:58,280
Heart rate, blood pressure, glucose. Calm trends, never alarms.

23
00:00:58,830 --> 00:01:01,380
Every medication counted, so nothing runs out.

24
00:01:01,930 --> 00:01:05,280
Ask it anything. It answers only from their own records.

25
00:01:05,830 --> 00:01:09,380
One caregiver, three people. RUA holds them all.

26
00:01:10,189 --> 00:01:13,330
Sensitive health information, kept private on your own device.

27
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:16,579
RUA.

28
00:01:17,579 --> 00:01:18,639
For everyone you care for.

